  "term": "Zofran",
  "definition": "Zofran is ondansetron hydrochloride, a drug that blocks serotonin 5-HT3 receptors. It is used to reduce nausea and vomiting, including those caused by chemotherapy or radiotherapy, by acting in the gut and in brain areas involved in triggering vomiting.",
